# This profile mirrors the section layout from the example main config and is
# meant as a practical starting point for a live site that archives into
# mounted paths under /ARCHiVE. Replace "SLAVE" with your actual live slave
# name and trim paths you do not use.
#
# The intended flow is:
# - live site "/" -> /ARCHiVE/*
# - optional second-stage offsite handling stays external (for example fin-space
#   + rclone) unless /OFFSITE is also mounted into GoFTPd
#
# Copy the rules below into plugins/spacekeeper/config.yml and enable the plugin
# from etc/config.yml when you want to start testing.
#
# Example thresholds:
# - incoming_disk_threshold_min_gb: 500
#     start archiving when live free space drops under 500 GiB
# - incoming_disk_threshold_target_gb: 650
#     stop once live free space is back above 650 GiB
